-- Ordered quest guidance; source 967020b2b8ca645afcaf90d9bbe5a1b64673947d; generated 2026-10-20.
QuestGuidance.Register("en",176,{
[5601]="7002C740\n1\tFrighten brigand horses at Hordfierd (total: 6)\tThe brigands' horses are located inside of Hordfierd, the large camp in south-west Parth Celebrant. Medwine has asked you to frighten the horses of the brigands.\n2\tTalk to Medwine\tMedwine is at Idmar's camp in central Parth Celebrant. You should return to Medwine with news of your success.\n",
[5602]="7002F92D\n1\tHelp Ordwacer with his problem\030Help Isenyd with his problem\tOrdwacer and Isenyd can be found within the city of Cliving. Frithelm has asked you to speak with the nobles Ordwacer and Isenyd and help them resolve their disputes.\n2\tTalk to Frithelm in Cliving\tFrithelm watches the road, just south of the fountain in the centre of Cliving. The soldier Frithelm will be pleased to know that you have settled the disputes of Ordwacer, Trumsele, Isenyd, and Giselmon.\n",
[5603]="700001DB\n1\tTalk to Frodo in Rivendell\tFrodo Baggins is in Bilbo's room on the first floor of the Last Homely House, in Rivendell. Gandalf the Grey has asked you to speak with Frodo Baggins and gauge his state-of-mind.\n2\tTalk to Frodo in Rivendell and take a walk with him\tFrodo Baggins is in Bilbo's room on the first floor of the Last Homely House, in Rivendell. Frodo is waiting to take a walk with you in the cool air.\n3\tTalk to Gandalf in Rivendell\tGandalf the Grey is in Bilbo's room on the first floor of the Last Homely House, in Rivendell. You and Frodo walked the grounds of Rivendell, and he expressed his concerns to you. Gandalf is waiting to hear your opinion of the hobbit's state-of-mind.\n",
[5604]="70046BF7\n1\tTalk to Mablung\030Talk to Rhadrog\030Talk to Laeglaw\tMablung, Rhadrog, and Laeglaw can be found at Henneth Annûn. Anborn has asked you to speak with the other Rangers about the coming days of the War.\n2\tTalk to Anborn\tAnborn can be found at Henneth Annûn in North Ithilien. You have spoken to the other Rangers and should now report back to Anborn.\n",
[5605]="7001AF94\n1\tBring the seeds to Bob Redthistle\030Collect seeds from corrupted trees (total: 8)\tThere are corrupted trees from the Old Forest in the southern Barrow-downs. Bob Redthistle is at the Dead Man's Perch. Bob Redthistle has asked you to collect seeds from the corrupted trees in the Barrow-downs and return them to him.\n",
[5606]="70060DA2\n1\tCollect barley from the fields (total: 10)\tBarley can be found in the fields of southern Yondershire. You should collect barley from the fields.\n2\tMalt the barley\tA malting container can be found in the village of Nobottle. You should add the barley to the malting container.\n3\tMash the barley\tA mashing pot can be found in the village of Nobottle. You should add the malted barley to the mashing pot.\n4\tBoil the brew\tA boiling pot can be found in the village of Nobottle. You should add the barley to the boiling pot.\n5\tFerment the brew\tA fermenting container can be found in the village of Nobottle. You should add the boiled brew to the fermenting container.\n6\tCollect empty bottles from the farm and from The Fox and Fiddle Inn (total: 12)\tEmpty bottles can be found around the farm, and both outside and inside The Fox and Fiddle Inn in the village of Nobottle. You should collect some empty bottles while you wait for the brew to ferment.\n7\tFill empty bottles (quantity: see journal)\tA fermenting container can be found in the village of Nobottle. You should bottle the brew with the empty bottles that you collected.\n8\tTalk to Brewmaster Bloda Hopblossom\tBrewmaster Bloda Hopblossom can be found in the village of Nobottle. You should talk to Brewmaster Bloda Hopblossom.\n9\tDeliver brews to The Brimful Quiver\030Deliver brews to The Roaring Bull\030Deliver brews to The Fox and Fiddle\030Deliver brews to The Elbow's Bend\030Receive a token of gratitude from each tavern-keep (total: 4)\tTaverns can be found in each of the four villages in Yondershire. You should deliver your brews to each of the four taverns in Yondershire.\n10\tCompleted\tDelivered brews!\n",
[5607]="70060D86\n1\tVisit The Fox and Fiddle in Nobottle\030Find Fredegar Bolger\030Visit Nobottle's village centre\030Visit Nobottle Farm\tNobottle can be found in eastern Yondershire. Salga Greengrass has asked you to explore the village of Nobottle.\n2\tTalk to Rosalinda North-took in Long Cleeve\tThe village of Long Cleeve can be found north of Nobottle in Yondershire. You should travel to Long Cleeve and talk to Rosalinda North-took.\n3\tVisit the Long Cleeve gazebo\030Visit Long Cleeve's village centre\030Visit The Roaring Bull in Long Cleeve\tThe village of Long Cleeve can be found north of Nobottle in Yondershire. Rosalinda North-took has asked you to explore the village of Long Cleeve.\n",
[5608]="700430D1\n1\tRefugees of Minas Tirith can be found throughout Tumladen. Faltharan has asked you to speak to many of the refugees in Tumladen so he might learn more of the growing conflict in the east.\t\n2\tTalk to Faltharan in Tumladen\tFaltharan can be found in Tumladen in northern Upper Lebennin. You have spoken to many of the refugees camped in Tumladen and should now return to Faltharan.\n",
[5609]="7003A5E8\n1\tCollect crates of tent sheets (total: 6)\030Collect tent posts (total: 8)\tCrates of tent sheets and tent posts can be found throughout Underharrow and Upbourn. Ellen Fremedon has asked you to gather tents in preparation for the journey to Dunharrow. Supplies have been spread through Underharrow and Upbourn.\n2\tTalk to Ellen Fremedon\tEllen Fremedon can be found outside the Mead Hall of Underharrow. You have collected all of the tent supplies in Underharrow and Upbourn. You should now return to Ellen Fremedon.\n",
[5610]="70022D7D\n1\tThe Forsaken Inn is along the Great East Road leading out of the South-gate in Bree. If you travel for a goodly while, you will find the inn on the north side of the road there. Find The Forsaken Inn and speak with the patrons there.\t\n",
[5611]="7003E40C\n1\tFind the bear-den beneath Thorenhad\tThe bear-den lies off the road to the north-west of Arrod's camp, in the shadow of Thorenhad. Arrod asked you to search the bear-den for evidence of what transpired between Caledhroval and the hendroval.\n2\tSearch for evidence at the bear-den\tThe bear-den lies off the road to the north-west of Arrod's camp, in the shadow of Thorenhad. Arrod asked you to search the bear-den for evidence of what transpired between Caledhroval and the hendroval.\n3\tBring Caledhroval to Arrod\tArrod is encamped in the Bruinen Gorges, upon the cliff overlooking the eastward road, south-east of the bear-den. You should bring Caledhroval to Arrod at once, so that the Elf may tend to his friend's wounds.\n",
[5612]="70060D81\n1\tVisit The Elbow's Bend in Tighfield\030Visit the Tighfield Farm\030Visit Tighfield village centre\tTighfield can be found in central Yondershire. Frothard Took has asked you to explore the hamlet of Tighfield.\n2\tTalk to Gytha Beatbrush in Gamwich\tThe village of Gamwich can be found north of Tighfield in Yondershire. You should travel to Gamwich and talk to Gytha Beatbrush.\n3\tVisit The Brimful Quiver in Gamwich\030Visit Gamwich's fishing hole\030Visit the hunting trail\tThe village of Gamwich can be found north of Tighfield in Yondershire. Gytha Beatbrush has asked you to explore the village of Gamwich.\n",
[5613]="700267CF\n1\tGain admittance to the village of Galtrev in Pren Gwydh\tGaltrev, the main village of Pren Gwydh, can be found by taking the road south-east from Lhan Tarren in Trum Dreng. You should go to Galtrev as you make your way through Dunland.\n",
[5614]="70026E6D\n1\tFind the Orc-cave in the north-east Heathfells\tOrcs can be found in the northern Heathfells. Cadfrith has asked you to defeat bands of Orcs that have crept into the northern Heathfells in hope that you can discover from whence they came.\n2\tTalk to Ondor the Dwarf at the Orc-cave\tOndor the Dwarf is at the Orc-cave in the north-east Heathfells. You should speak with the dwarf Ondor.\n",
[5615]="70052B25\n1\tMálvang can be found along the road to Laerlad, far to the south of Hultvís. Desperate to uncover anything that may have survived the War, Madelgard has asked you to search the ruined village of Málvang.\t\n2\tSearch the burned dwellings at Málvang\tYou should investigate the burned dwellings.\n3\tExamine the footprints in the burned dwellings at Málvang\tFootprints can be found in each of the burned dwellings at Málvang. You have discovered a number of fresh footprints in the burned dwellings at Málvang. You should examine them more closely before returning to Hultvís.\n4\tTalk to Madelgard\tMadelgard can be found in Hultvís. You have not found anything that survived the War except for a singed, plundered strongbox and curiously small footprints. You should return to Madelgard and tell her what you have discovered.\n",
[5616]="7002A170\n1\tGain admittance to the village of Galtrev in Pren Gwydh\tGaltrev, the main village of Pren Gwydh, can be found by taking the road south from the Bonevales. You should go to Galtrev as you make your way through Dunland.\n",
[5617]="70000CF0\n1\tTalk to Mayor Graeme Tenderlarch\tTravel east along the road to Bree. The Bounder suggested you might find your fortune in the town of Bree. Speak to the Mayor once you arrive.\n",
[5618]="7005A679\n1\tTravel to Sadauk-kala\tSadauk-kala can be found in western Máttugard. You should travel to Sadauk-kala.\n2\tDefeat enemies at Sadauk-kala (total: 10)\tSadauk-kala can be found in western Máttugard. You should defeat enemies at Sadauk-kala.\n3\tSummon and confront the Iron Crown emissary\tSadauk-kala can be found in western Máttugard. You should confront the Iron Crown emissary.\n4\tSummon and confront the Iron Crown emissary\tSadauk-kala can be found in western Máttugard. You should confront the Iron Crown emissary.\n5\tTalk to Voina\tVoina can be found at Zidir-nesad, the Steepset, in Máttugard. You should talk to Voina.\n",
[5619]="7005AAFA\n1\tDefeat ice-giants (total: 12)\tThe ice-giants have chosen to ally with the Frost-horde and the Angmarim. You should defeat ice-giants in Thyrstáth.\n2\tCall Hórin and talk to him\tHórin can be called to your side with the Call Hórin item. You should talk to Hórin.\n",
[5620]="70006FB7\n1\tBring Frostmantle's horn to Bolli\030Collect Frostmantle's horn\tFrostmantle roams the area by the old obelisk in hills west of Frerin's Court. Slay the aurochs called \"Frostmantle\" and bring back one of its horns to Bolli as proof of your victory.\n",
[5621]="700461CF\n1\tCollect frozen sweet-cream\tFrozen sweet-cream can be obtained from Bluet Goldworthy's vendor stand in Bywater. You should collect the ingredients for Tansy's frozen treat.\n2\tCollect fresh fruit from the market in Bywater\tFresh fruit can also be obtained from Bywater's market. You should collect the ingredients for Tansy's frozen treat.\n3\tGet honey from the Green Dragon\tSweet honey can surely be found at the Green Dragon Inn in Bywater, where the innkeep crafts delicious mead for his patrons. You should collect the ingredients for Tansy's frozen treat.\n4\tMix the dessert\tUse the bowl to assemble the ingredients of Tansy's frozen treat – frozen sweet-cream, fresh fruit, and honey.\n5\tBring the frozen dessert to Tansy Tighfield\tTansy Tighfield is at the Party Tree in Hobbiton. You should bring Tansy the frozen treat to reward her for her hard work at the Summer Festival.\n",
[5622]="70041243\n1\tThe Orc camp is to the west of Artamir's encampment, in the Dead Marshes. Artamir has asked you to search storage caches in the Orc camp, to see if they have recovered the Banner of King Ondoher from the mud and the marsh-waters.\t\n2\tTalk to Artamir at his camp in the Dead Marshes\tYou have found no sign that the Orcs have recovered the Banner of King Ondoher, and should return to Artamir at his camp.\n",
[5623]="7000838D\n1\tBring the root vegetables back to Eetu at Lehmä-koti\030Collect root vegetables (total: 10)\tThe root vegetables grow in the gorges on the east side of Ram Dúath in the Duvairë. Eetu has asked you to gather vegetables for the Earth-kin of the Suuri-lehmä.\n",
[5624]="70009980\n1\tCollect colourful berries (total: 6)\tThe berries can be found south of the Eavespires and east of Amon Môth. Lithuifin has asked you to collect some colourful berries and bring them to him.\n2\tBring the berries you collected to Lithuifin\tLithuifin resides at the Eavespires, east and north of Amon Môth, along the shoreline of Lake Evendim. You should bring the berries you collected to Lithuifin.\n",
[5625]="70016B92\n1\tBurn wood-piles (total: 6)\tWood piles can be found in Drû-garmadh, south-east of Mekhem-bizru. Dagfari, hoping to delay the construction of any siege-weapons, wants you to head to Drû-garmadh and burn the wood-piles in the Orc-camp.\n2\tTalk to Dagfari at Mekhem-bizru\tDagfari is at Mekhem-bizru, north-west of Drû-garmadh. Dagfari will be pleased to know you burned the Orcs' supply of wood.\n",
[5626]="7005B111\n1\tCollect cut wood (total: 8)\030Collect fallen branches (total: 8)\tCut wood and fallen branches can be found in the forests outside of Amdân. Thorin has asked you to gather wood for the Haban'akkâ of Thráin.\n2\tDeliver the wood to Thorin at Amdân\tThorin can be found at Amdân. You have collected a great deal of wood. You should deliver the wood to Thorin.\n",
[5627]="70008343\n1\tCollect Angmar coal (quantity: see journal)\tSpecial hot-burning coal deposits can be found throughout the canyons north of the city of Donnvail, north-east of Fail-á-Khro. Ekhagan has asked you to gather the special hot-burning coal he needs to work the old black iron of Angmar.\n2\tBring Angmar coal and coal-pick to Ekhagan\tEkhagan is at Fail-á-Khro, south-west of the city of Donnvail. You should return to Ekhagan with the special hot-burning coal you have mined.\n",
[5628]="70022B00\n1\tFind Lhe Colvarn\tLhe Colvarn, an ancient crypt below Drug Haniad, may be found due east of the main road, in the southern portion of the Lich Bluffs. A small crypt opening that has been dug into the ground. Mincham asked you to locate the entrance to Lhe Colvarn and enter therein.\n2\tRetrieve and destroy components (total: 6)\tThe wights and their ritual components may be found in Lhe Colvarn, beneath Drug Haniad, south of Mincham's camp. Mincham asked you to enter Lhe Colvarn and destroy the wights' ritual components.\n3\tTalk to Mincham in the Lich Bluffs\tMincham's camp is located north of Drug Haniad, along the road. You should return to Mincham and let him know that you retrieved and destroyed the ritual components of the wights at Lhe Colvarn.\n",
[5629]="7006BF6F\n1\tCollect boar meat from healthy boars near Shakhdag (total: 6)\030Gather healthy berries near Shakhdag (total: 10)\030Gather sticks for kindling near Shakhdag (total: 8)\tGirnada, the quartermaster of Urmâkh, has asked you to gather supplies for the villagers in Shakhdag, as food and supplies are scarce in Urmâkh. Shakhdag is located just outside Urmâkh, to the west.\n2\tReturn to Girnada in Urmâkh\tReturn to Girnada in Urmâkh with all you've collected.\n",
[5630]="70044E3C\n1\tFind the settlement of hobbits in the Gloomglens\tBingo has learned that there may be hobbits living in the Gloomglens in north-west Enedwaith, and he wants to investigate and learn if it is true.\n2\tTalk to Bingo in the Gloomglens\tYou have found a settlement of hobbits in the Gloomglens.\n3\tTalk to Rhus Cornchúthur\030Talk to Iola Isbrun\tRhus Cornchúthur and Iola Isbrun are keeping watch near the entrance to the hobbit-village in the Gloomglens.\n4\tTalk to Iolo Brochtû in the north part of Maur Tulhau\tIolo Brochtû, the Maer of Maur Tulhau, can be found outside his house in the north of the hobbit village.\n5\tDefeat wolves in the Gloomglens (total: 4)\030Collect boar-meat in the Gloomglens (total: 4)\030Collect stag-meat from the Gloomglens (total: 2)\030Collect root vegetables south-east of Maur Tulhau (total: 6)\030Obtain ingredients from Violed Isbrun\030Obtain ingredients from Iago Glennudh\030Obtain ingredients from Caradog Henbuch\tIolo Brochtû has suggested that you speak to the villagers of Maur Tulhau and collect ingredients for a welcoming feast from the forest outside the village.\n6\tBring ingredients for the Welcoming Feast to Cadel Balchtrod in Maur Tulhau\tCadel Balchtrod, the provisioner of Maur Tulhau, is in the central square of the village. You have acquired numerous ingredients for the Welcoming Feast, and should bring them to the provisioner of Maur Tulhau.\n7\tTalk to Bingo at the Welcoming Feast, in north-east Maur Tulhau\tBingo is ready for the Welcoming Feast, and is waiting for you by the water in the north-east corner of Maur Tulhau.\n",
[5631]="70018E26\n1\tBring the miner's pick-axes to Hersir at Gharâf-fehem in the Redhorn Lodes\030Collect miner's pick-axes (total: 8)\tThe entrance to Fulz-zahar lies within Gharâf-fehem Hersir has asked that you enter Fulz-zahar and collect pick-axes to aid in the re-establishment of the Mines of Moria.\n",
[5632]="70018E23\n1\tDefeat intruders in Fulz-zahar (total: 20)\tThe entrance to Fulz-zahar lies within Gharâf-fehem. Hersir has asked you to assist him in clearing Fulz-zahar of the vermin within.\n2\tTalk to Hersir at Gharâf-fehem\tHersir is at Gharâf-fehem. You should return to Hersir with news of your success.\n",
})
